<title>SWITZERLAND: Stratec boosts '96 net, sees good 1997.</title>
<headline>Stratec boosts '96 net, sees good 1997.</headline>
<dateline>OBERDORF, Switzerland 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996 (in million Swiss francs)</p>
<p> Group Sales			 224.6	  vs   184.5</p>
<p> EBIT				   51.5	  vs    39.4</p>
<p> Net profit			   36.2	  vs    25.7</p>
<p> Cash flow			    47.0	  vs    34.2</p>
<p>Note - Stratec Holding AG, which makes osteosynthesis and prosthetics products, said it aimed to exceed clearly in 1997 its goal of 11 percent sales growth. &quot;Thanks to active cost control during this development phase, a further improvement of ROS (return on sales) is expected.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631</p>
</text>
